   | Blind calibration loses 0.54 pts going from sigma=0 to sigma=20%.
   | Under a few points: the contribution stands as written -- the correction is
   | computable at compile time from the programmed targets alone.
   | Larger, but write-verify holds: the contribution becomes 'calibrate from measured
